    {
      "Seq": 19,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 6,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 15902,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I find myself in the village square, at noon, and it feels like a repetition of hiding during the looting. The well and the thorn hedge are the same, but now I can see the mounting block and the wayside cross, just as I did when I played with friends and watched looters raid. I am drawn to the village stocks, their leg-holes polished by use, much like the wooden bench where I sat while waiting for my turn to be scolded by the village elder.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 20,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 6,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 15902,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I notice the deep stone-rimmed well at the square\u0027s heart, its wooden bucket on its rope, a scent of damp earth and the faintest hint of moss. I wish to examine it closely, relying on the plain ways of country folk, for it is at its best in this calm, ready to be tended with the patience of one who knows waiting has its price.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 21,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 6,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 15902,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I want not to stand and look at the well. I want to act, not stand and observe. It fails if I pause, but it succeeds if I work, my hands knowing the well\u0027s depth.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 22,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 6,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Square",
      "LocationId": 15902,
      "Actor": "Kenryc Greygate",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I will not examine the well closely, for that will not do, and I have learned the price of waiting. I could still examine the well closely, another way. I will rely on the trapping and stalking of small game, for it is the hour when the scent and colour of prey peak, and the calm of waiting does not mar this moment\u0027s perfection.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
